 game mode maybe  there's a bug that happens on one  reviewer but not the other but in terms  of myself i had a good experience sure  there was a couple hiccups but it was  nothing drastic enough to make me think  it would impact any of your guys's  experience playing this game now clearly  this is a racing type of game so we're  gonna have a lot of races in this game  what i really enjoyed about this that i  know they've had in previous fours but i  never really got to experience a whole  lot of them because i didn't really play  any of the old forces is the showcases  in this game you'll be racing a plane  and then you'll be raising ski jets  these showcases in the game i would say  some of the highlights of forza horizon  5. it gives you that sensation that  you're right on their neck and it can be  head-to-head all the way up to the very  end and a lot of these showcases it was  neck to neck into the variant and you  barely come through at the very end and  get that w and it gives you a lot of  winning sensation that you actually  accomplished something because it was a  rough race now i will say it does look  like it doesn't really seem to be that  you can actually get ahead of some of  these objects that you race in these  showcases but it does seem like you know  it is always set to make it to where it  feels like you are always head-to-head  with these objects and you know racing a  plane how could you really realistically  beat a plane in a race but i do like the  way they set it up to where it feels  like you're on the edge of your seat the  entire time you're doing these events  and you know speaking of events they  actually have these  certain big races that you can do in  every area and every aspect of every  type of event you can do where it pretty  much is that event that you've been  racing with regardless if it's offline  roading or street racing but they it's  that pretty much grand prix it's  whatever  that highest level of thing that you can  race in that and every one of them seems  to have one like i was mentioning  earlier there is one that literally  takes you around the entire map and it  took me about 15 to 20 minutes to do the  off-road one was a very good experience  as well and that took me about 20 to 25  minutes sure some of these feel like  they're a little bit dragged out and  maybe pull them back a little bit for  future installments in my opinion  obviously i'm not really a huge racer so  i can understand if a lot of the other  gamers that love these type of games  like that but to me it did feel a little  bit just drawn out like by the time i  finished some of these races i was done  i wanted to turn off forza horizon it  didn't necessarily you know mean it was  a bad thing it just meant like i felt  like i was racing forever and sure it  was really good of experience in terms  of doing some of these races where it  took you around the whole map it was fun  doing it one time but after doing it  more than one time it kind of felt a  little bit redundant because i felt like  i would race around the map and i was  you know really taking in all the  aspects that this mexico map that  playground games has designed and built  in forza horizon 5. but by the time you  go around the whole map one time you  don't really in particular my case don't  want to do those long long races a lot  but keep in mind to my knowledge and  what i played at the game and i played a  lot of the game it did not seem like  those races was a lot of them it did  seem like they were in this and it  seemed like there was one for every type  of race that you can get but it didn't  seem like it was a lot of them and i'm  not saying that more of them would have  been an issue i'm not saying less of  them would have been an issue i'm saying  that when i did one i really dreaded  doing the other ones because it's not  necessarily on if i could do it or not  do it i was just dreading the amount of  time it took to do those races because  it was such a long distance that you had  to race the other drivers now clearly we  got to talk about the cars man we got to  talk about the cars because this is a  forza horizon game there's a lot of cars  and i can't tell you about really any of  them not really a racing kind of person  i'm not really a car person in general i  picked the porsche and i picked the  porsche because in need for speed most  wanted i want to pour off a blacklist  member and until this day that's the  kind of car i want to drive sure was  there a lot of different options here  you get cars for just about anything i  didn't buy a lot of cars in this game  there were some i did buy but for the  most part you just win cars you win  massive amounts of cars you do anything  you win cars you do any type of skills  any type of achievements that's in the  game you win cars so they always are  able to give you something new to drive  and if you're a real big car maniac like  as some of my friends are i'm sure  you're going to spend hours in there  designing your own designs making the  cars look good they have a huge social  aspect in this game to where you can  make your design and they'll actually  give it to other people and let them  download it and actually write you if  you like that design or not and i think  that's a really good aspect once again  with the social aspect now let's talk a  little bit about the customization  and your avatars and stuff i felt like  they could improve on this not everyone  dresses the same and i went through an  entire page it was literally almost the  exact same type of clothes just slightly  altered and i'm not saying  that there isn't stuff you can unlock  because throughout the game you do  unlock stuff you unlock horns you unlock  you know emotes but when it comes to the  customization and how you look i feel  like the industry in general needs to be  better on this everyone dresses  differently that people like to voice  their expression in the way they look  and if you don't give people the options  to do this effectively you're gonna see  a lot of people get upset in terms of  how you look in this game did it bother  me not really because i didn't really  pay attention to the look of my actual  avatar in the game because to me this  game's more about the racing than  anything else it's not really about the  avatar but i do want to mention to you  guys that if you're a huge customization  person there is a lot of customization  that you can get in this game there's a  lot that you can unlock in this game  there's a lot that you keep at the gate  in this game but i do feel like they  need more variety and more diversity in  terms of the type of clothes that you  can buy in this game but anyway that's  the review on forza horizon 5 man like i  felt like this is a solid experience i  would give it the iron lords podcast  still it's definitely worth downloading  on game pass and even buying it for full  price on the store i think it's a very  effective game looks very good has a lot  of social aspects that you can play this  with your friends for a long time and  it's got great gameplay it's got great  races that you can do there's a lot of  stuff to do here in terms of content  content's king and forza horizon 5 has a  lot of content and i think the majority  of people that even have a remote like  in terms of the racing genre maybe not  people like such as myself because i'm  kind of on that edge to where i don't  need to play racing games i play racing  games when they appeal to me and when my  friends want me to play and for the most  part everyone on the iron lures podcast  everyone in the comments section  everyone in the community always told me  attic you got to try the forza horizon  games and i tried it and i can honestly  say  it definitely gave me the sensations  that i wanted and i recommend it to  everyone that's watching this video go  out there try it out man it's a very  good game but anyway that's for the  review man definitely put in the comment  section below how you feel about forza  horizon 5 is this something that you  guys are excited about until next time  this is lord addict i'm outta here peace
 

